flowchart TB
    %% Design view: rule source shape from JSON to compiled rules and actions.
    classDef core fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#6d28d9,color:#2e1065
    classDef ok fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#047857,color:#064e3b
    classDef bad fill:#fef2f2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    classDef note fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#334155,color:#0f172a

    Src["rule source JSON"]:::core
    Head["rule_set, revision,<br/>match_mode, input_contract"]:::core
    Rules["rules array"]:::core

    Src --> Head
    Src --> Rules

    Rule["one rule<br/>id, name, priority, tags"]:::core
    Rules --> Rule

    When["when: predicate tree"]:::core
    Then["then: actions on match"]:::ok
    Other["otherwise: actions on no match<br/>first_match only, lowest priority rule"]:::note

    Rule --> When
    Rule --> Then
    Rule --> Other

    All["all: every child true"]:::core
    Any["any: at least one child true"]:::core
    Not["not: inverts one child"]:::core
    Leaf["leaf: path, op, value"]:::core

    When --> All
    When --> Any
    When --> Not
    When --> Leaf
    All --> Any
    Any --> Not
    Not --> Leaf

    Ops["ops: eq, neq, gt, gte, lt, lte,<br/>in, not_in, exists, not_exists<br/>path must start with dollar-dot"]:::note
    Leaf --> Ops

    Emit["emit: topic and data<br/>effect_type emit"]:::ok
    Cmd["command: destination, name, data<br/>effect_type command"]:::ok
    Then --> Emit
    Then --> Cmd

    Limits["Compiler rejects:<br/>empty source, missing id or revision,<br/>unknown match mode, duplicate rule ids,<br/>duplicate priorities, depth over 10,<br/>over 100 rules or 200 predicates,<br/>over 10 actions, payload over 256KB,<br/>more than one action per rule"]:::bad
    Head -.-> Limits
    Rules -.-> Limits
